<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - New Era started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - New Era started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of New Era of Networks Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- New Era gained 3/4 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>-- New Era launched its initial public offering on June 18.</p>
</text>
